# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback for /demo/ (open-slide deck deep links).
#
# Real files at /demo/index.html and /demo/assets/* are served directly by
# Pages because they exist on disk. Only deep-link paths under /demo/s/*
# (and other open-slide router paths) need to fall back to /demo/index.html
# so the client-side router can render the requested slide.
#
# Status 200 = rewrite (URL stays as user sees it), not a 301/302 redirect.

/demo/s/*       /demo/index.html        200
/demo/themes/*  /demo/index.html        200
